</div><p class="dialog-lead">
Zoltán Stempel was born in 1975 in Cluj-Napoca. He initially embarked on his martial arts journey practicing the Shotokan style before seamlessly transitioning to Wado-ryu karate. A dedicated father of two, he has devoted over 30 years to karate instruction. Beyond karate, he has also cultivated his skills in Iaido.
</p>
<h4 class="dialog-section-title">About Sensei Zoltán</h4>
