	<li><i class="fas fa-medal"></i> Holds an official national sports coaching certification.</li>
	<li><i class="fas fa-medal"></i> Conducts over 10 training sessions weekly across 3 different age groups.</li>
	<li><i class="fas fa-medal"></i> Serves as an esteemed member of the MWKSZ board of examiners.</li>
	<li><i class="fas fa-medal"></i> Organizes and leads 3 summer day camps annually for young children.</li>
